ver exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".\n\nDATA (build the UI around this content):\n{\n  \"persona\": {\n    \"name\": \"Mira Kovač\",\n    \"role\": \"Product designer\",\n    \"city\": \"Ljubljana\",\n    \"bio\": \"I design calm, usable software for public services and small teams. Ten years across research, interaction design and front-end prototyping.\",\n    \"availability\": \"Open to freelance work from January\",\n    \"email\": \"mira@example.com\",\n    \"links\": [\n      \"Dribbble\",\n      \"LinkedIn\",\n      \"Read.cv\"\n    ],\n    \"stats\": [\n      {\n        \"label\": \"Years designing\",\n        \"value\": \"10\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"label\": \"Products shipped\",\n        \"value\": \"24\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"label\": \"People reached\",\n        \"value\": \"1.2M\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"skills\": [\n      \"Interaction design\",\n      \"User research\",\n      \"Design systems\",\n      \"Prototyping\",\n      \"Service design\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"projects\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Transit app redesign\",\n      \"year\": 2026,\n      \"role\": \"Lead designer\",\n      \"client\": \"Ljubljana Public Transport\",\n      \"summary\": \"Cut trip-planning taps from 7 to 3 for 400k riders.\",\n      \"outcome\": \"App store rating rose from 3.4 to 4.6 in six months.\",\n      \"tags\": [\n        \"mobile\",\n        \"research\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Clinic booking system\",\n      \"year\": 2025,\n      \"role\": \"Product designer\",\n      \"client\": \"Zdravje Clinics\",\n      \"summary\": \"Self-serve booking that halved front-desk calls.\",\n      \"outcome\": \"58% fewer booking calls; 91% of patients book online.\",\n      \"tags\": [\n        \"web\",\n        \"service design\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Open data dashboard\",\n      \"year\": 2024,\n      \"role\": \"Design and front-end\",\n      \"client\": \"City of Ljubljana\",\n      \"summary\": \"City budget explorer used by 30k residents.\",\n      \"outcome\": \"Featured by two national newspapers; open-sourced.\",\n      \"tags\": [\n        \"data viz\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"testimonial\": {\n    \"quote\": \"Mira turned a tangle of requirements into something our riders actually enjoy using.\",\n    \"author\": \"Tina Zupan\",\n    \"role\": \"Head of Digital, LPP\"\n  }\n}","systemHash":"7f7b03405c279f095db892fdd24437dfc241ff3c8abb65e91da9e557823238ce","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<style>\n.hero{padding:2rem 0 1rem}\n.tags{display:flex;gap:.4rem;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.proj-year{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\nblockquote{margin:0;font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.5}\n.filters{display:flex;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n\n<header class=\"hero stack\">\n  <div class=\"row between\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem\">\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm center\">\n      <div class=\"avatar\">MK</div>\n      <div>\n        <div><strong>Mira Kovač</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"muted small\">Product designer · Ljubljana</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"badge\">Open to freelance work from January</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Calm, usable software for public services and small teams.</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">I design calm, usable software for public services and small teams. Ten years across research, interaction design and front-end prototyping.</p>\n  <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap\">\n    <a class=\"btn btn-lg\" href=\"mailto:mira@example.com\">Get in touch</a>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-outline btn-lg\" href=\"#work\">View selected work</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<section class=\"grid cols-3\">\n  <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Years designing</div><div class=\"stat-value\">10</div></div>\n  <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Products shipped</div><div class=\"stat-value\">24</div></div>\n  <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"stat-label\">People reached</div><div class=\"stat-value\">1.2M</div></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"stack\" id=\"work\">\n  <div class=\"row between\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem\">\n    <div>\n      <h2>Selected work</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Three recent projects, newest first.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"filters\" id=\"filters\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-sm\" data-f=\"all\">All</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\" data-f=\"mobile\">Mobile</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\" data-f=\"web\">Web</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\" data-f=\"research\">Research</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\" data-f=\"data viz\">Data viz</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"stack\" id=\"projects\">\n    <article class=\"card stack\" data-tags=\"mobile,research\">\n      <div class=\"row between\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap\">\n        <div>\n          <h3 class=\"card-title\">Transit app redesign</h3>\n          <div class=\"muted small\">Ljubljana Public Transport · Lead designer</div>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-secondary proj-year\">2026</span>\n      </div>\n      <p>Cut trip-planning taps from 7 to 3 for 400k riders.</p>\n      <div class=\"alert\"><strong>Outcome:</strong> App store rating rose from 3.4 to 4.6 in six months.</div>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">mobile</span><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">research</span></div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"card stack\" data-tags=\"web,service design\">\n      <div class=\"row between\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap\">\n        <div>\n          <h3 class=\"card-title\">Clinic booking system</h3>\n          <div class=\"muted small\">Zdravje Clinics · Product designer</div>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-secondary proj-year\">2025</span>\n      </div>\n      <p>Self-serve booking that halved front-desk calls.</p>\n      <div class=\"alert\"><strong>Outcome:</strong> 58% fewer booking calls; 91% of patients book online.</div>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">web</span><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">service design</span></div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"card stack\" data-tags=\"data viz\">\n      <div class=\"row between\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap\">\n        <div>\n          <h3 class=\"card-title\">Open data dashboard</h3>\n          <div class=\"muted small\">City of Ljubljana · Design and front-end</div>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-secondary proj-year\">2024</span>\n      </div>\n      <p>City budget explorer used by 30k residents.</p>\n      <div class=\"alert\"><strong>Outcome:</strong> Featured by two national newspapers; open-sourced.</div>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">data viz</span></div>\n    </article>\n\n    <p class=\"muted center\" id=\"empty\" style=\"display:none\">No projects match this filter.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"card stack\">\n  <blockquote>“Mira turned a tangle of requirements into something our riders actually enjoy using.”</blockquote>\n  <div class=\"row gap-sm center\">\n    <div class=\"avatar\">TZ</div>\n    <div><strong>Tina Zupan</strong><div class=\"muted small\">Head of Digital, LPP</div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"stack\">\n  <h2>Skil